 a friend about some shots earlier, so could you pull up the pictures I marked as favourites?\"], [\"appointments this weekend?\", \"and saturday?\", \"who's at the Alasdair one?\", \"my favourite pics\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0051\", \"v\": [[\"My camera roll is an absolute mess and I'm finally clearing it out, so could you delete the kabaddi photo for me?\", \"Also, I'm trying to get the garden sorted before things get away from me, so what's still left to do on the nasturtium plan?\"], [\"pls delete the kabaddi photo\", \"oh and whats left to do on the nasturtium plan\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0052\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the shelf photo?\", \"Also, would you mind logging a call with Valentin, please? I called him.\", \"It was Valentin Iglesias, thank you.\"], [\"umm can you delete the, uh, the shelf photo?\", \"oh and, uh, Valentin, I called Valentin, can you log that for me?\", \"oh sorry, the, um, Iglesias one, Valentin Iglesias\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I need to renew my permit and I can't remember what I saved, so can you pull up the parking login entry from my locker? Just the entry itself, not the password.\"], [\"can u find the parking login in my locker? just the entry not the pw\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0054\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's the, uh, the parking login… what's the actual password on it?\", \"ok different thing, can you move the oil task to next friday and, uh, the riddle one to friday?\", \"oh and, um, get rid of the buy task\", \"oops, no no, undo that\", \"ok and, uh, the conservatory repair appointment… could that go to tomorrow at quarter past eleven instead?\"], [\"whats the parking login password\", \"move the oil task to next friday and the riddle to friday pls\", \"also bin the buy task\", \"oops undo that\", \"can the conservatory repair appt go to tomorrow at quarter past eleven instead?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0055\", \"v\": [[\"For the Yetunde, I'm trying to get a rough headcount together, so who is actually coming along?\", \"I've just phoned the third one to sort a few things out, so can you log that call for me?\", \"Right, switching over, I'm trying to plan out my day, so what's on today?\"], [\"Yetunde, who is coming?\", \"phoned the third one, log it\", \"what's on today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I want to make sure I'm actually free for it, so the Yetunde one, when is that happening?\", \"Oh, I deleted the mistletoe photo by accident while I was tidying up, could you put it back for me?\", \"Just out of curiosity, I've been wondering how big my address book has got, so how many people do I have in my contacts?\", \"Fraser's sorting a booking for both of us, so could you text Fraser the Mastercard card?\", \"Different thing, I need to get in touch with someone, so can you pull up Valentin Joshi's contact card?\"], [\"Yetunde, when?\", \"restore the mistletoe photo\", \"how many contacts do I have?\", \"text Fraser the Mastercard card\", \"Valentin Joshi's card\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0057\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a present sorted in good time for once, so when is Nanami's birthday?\", \"Also, I'm getting everyone organised for the group, so can you put Carran Inglewood in the Flemness trip?\"], [\"whens Nanami's birthday\", \"also add Carran Inglewood to Flemness trip pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when I'm meeting Nanami for coffee, please?\", \"Actually, never mind that, I'll check it myself later. Thank you anyway.\"], [\"I have a feeling I might have double-booked myself, so when is it I'm seeing Nanami for coffee?\", \"Oh actually, scrap that, I'm heading out the door now and I'll just have a look myself later on.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0059\", \"v\": [[\"I hate having money hanging over me, so could you settle up with Vrovsais Lindemann in thuvum gang?\", \"Also, I've given up on the dance classes completely, so please get rid of every flamenco event on my calendar.\"], [\"settle up w Vrovsais Lindemann in thuvum gang pls\", \"also delete every flamenco event\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w24-0060\", \"v\": [[\"alarm code 58285, save in locker\", \"birthdays next week?\", \"spent in September?\"], [\"the alarm code is 58285 can u keep it in the locker\", \"whose bdays r coming up next week\", \"how much did i spend back in September\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0001\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan things out a bit ahead of time, so which appointments have I got on monday?\", \"And today? I'm wondering whether I can squeeze anything else in.\"], [\"Could you tell me which appointments I have on monday, please?\", \"And what about today, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0002\", \"v\": [[\"my favourite pics\", \"how many?\", \"hang on, who's at call veikko?\", \"back to the faves, delete the second one\"], [\"umm can you show me the pics I favourited?\", \"how many of those are there?\", \"oh wait, hang on, who's gonna be at the, uh, call veikko?\", \"ok, going back to the favourite photos… umm, delete the second one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0003\", \"v\": [[\"philately stuff?\", \"first one an hour later\", \"no, wrong one, the second one\"], [\"whats in the vault about philately\", \"push the first one an hour later pls\", \"oops wrong one i meant the second one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0004\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind checking Jimhaven for me? I'd like to know how much I've spent there, please.\", \"I've been going to Jimhaven a lot lately and I'm getting a bit worried about my budget, so how much have I actually spent there?\"]]}","ttft_ms":35846,"type":"result","duration_ms":49195,"uuid":"ad2a284f-3398-4977-95e1-7b3f39c6f709","ttft_stream_ms":1442,"time_to_request_ms":168,"first_content_frame_ms":1442,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22293080,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278843517.5986,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
